2026-09-02T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2175) 'Abandon five RFDs (1132, 1140, 1163, 2133, 2138) whose decisions name RunPod or Vast.ai rented compute, which CLAUDE.md's hard constraint blocklisted when this was written. Each moves to `abandoned` alongside this document landing. The Compute rule re-allowed rented providers on 2026-11-04; the five stay abandoned to keep the scope down.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2175  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2175) 'Retracts: urn:oid:1.3.6.1.4.1.66606.1.1.{1132,1140,1163}, urn:oid:1.3.6.1.4.1.66606.1.2.{2133,2138} Anchor: CLAUDE.md's Compute hard constraint as it stood when this was written. Companion: RFD66606-2169 (studio-core abandonment), same class of walk-back.
