2026-09-02T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2175) '  RFD66606-1140  Rented GPUs on RunPod. Decision 'rented GPU work runs on RunPod' contradicts CLAUDE.md's RunPod blocklist. RFD66606-1132  Priority list of converted models. RunPod as serving interactor. Same contradiction. RFD66606-1163  The accelerator in the loops. 'flow runs on RunPod'. RFD66606-2133  The pool rents from the spot book. 'Rent single RTX 4090s from the vast.ai book'. RFD66606-2138  interactor-shuttle. Merges the spot-broker whose whole reason was renting vast.ai. Abandoned with 2133.
 # tags: rfd:details
